  "prefLabel": "Lab 1201.03 “Hot Water heater” as used in RSA 157-A: 6, III (g), RSA 157-A: 6, III IV and RSA 157-A: 8, II (c) means a vessel in which potable water is heated by the combus",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lab 1201.03 “Hot Water heater” as used in RSA 157-A: 6, III (g), RSA 157-A: 6, III IV and RSA 157-A: 8, II (c) means a vessel in which potable water is heated by the combustion of fuel, by electricity, or by and other source, and withdrawn for external use.\n\nSource. #11071, eff 4-11-16",
